OL,3,GNEWSAFilm buff brings town's cinema
OL,4,Aback to life after eight years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere may not be a red carpet - but it
OL,7,Fis still a big night in the history of
OL,8,Fcinema in a south of Scotland town.
OL,10,FWhen the 470-seater former Odeon in
OL,11,FDumfries closed its doors in the summer
OL,12,Fof 2018 it left it without a
OL,13,Flarge-scale movie theatre.
OL,15,FAfter more than two years of work, the
OL,16,Fdream of Elgin-based film fan Tristan
OL,17,FCampbell to bring it back to life will
OL,18,Fcome true with a screening of
OL,19,FFocker-in-Law starring Robert De Niro,
OL,20,FAriana Grande and Ben Stiller.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
